        {
          "text": "Nuko wa mugore w’umunyabwenge aja ku bantu b’iwabo ajanye inama yiwe y’ubwenge, baca bafata Sheba mwene Bikuri bamuca umutwe bawuterera Yowabu. Nuko aca avuza inzamba, abantu biwe baca bava muri ico gisagara, umwe wese yitahira iwe. Yowabu na we aca asubira i bwami i Yerusalemu.",
